/* ======================= SECTION SUMMARY (40% panel) =======================
   One summary record per left-nav section. Questions are always the source
   of truth: the extractor only ever reads answered values out of the DOM —
   it never invents content. A summary is either 'auto' (kept in sync on every
   committed field change) or 'edited' by the user (never silently overwritten;
   flagged 'stale' if the underlying answers move on afterward). */
let activeSectionKey='cc';
/* Free navigation: every section is always reachable -- scrolling and the
   nav rail / Summary "go to" controls are never blocked. unlockThrough() is
