<script>
/* =====================================================================
   [newclient] Dynamic Visit Note Summary -- applicability rules.
   The summary document (#vnsDoc) already has one section per left-panel
   section, grouped and ordered like the Visit Note tabs, and fills each
   one from that form (extractSectionFacts -> SSM -> renderSec).
   This layer only decides whether a section is APPLICABLE right now:
     'show'    -> listed; with data it shows the data, without data it
                  uses the existing compact "No data entered yet" row
     'content' -> listed only once it has data (never an empty row)
     'hide'    -> not applicable: not listed (answers in the form are kept)
